            "    & Score / SR & Att & Opt & Type & Price & Score / SR & Att & Opt & Type & Price\\\\\n",
            "\\midrule\n",
            "    Rule  & 45.8 / 19\\\n",
            "    IL    & 61.5 / 27\\\n",
            "    IL+RL & \\textbf{65.9} / \\textbf{25\\\n",
            "\\midrule\n",
